    "home_review_section_block_jqmK6d": {
      "type": "home-review-section-block",
      "blocks": {
        "testimonail_nLk4Ud": {
          "type": "Testimonail",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-07-30_at_11.48.35_AM.png",
            "text": "<p>This supplement has been crucial for recovery (especially putting in 60+ miles and 3-4 strength workouts a week) It used to take multiple days to recover from a hardcore speed workout. Now I’m recovered same day or at least by my run the next morning. Incredible.</p>",
            "author_name": "Cameron A",
            "author_name_text": "Runner"
          }
        },
        "testimonail_AwhF9i": {
          "type": "Testimonail",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-07-30_at_11.49.34_AM.png",
            "text": "<p>I was hesitant at first but gave Extreme Endurance a try. I took it consistantly and started see a shift upwards in FTP in about 3 weeks. It has also helped greatly with recovery. I'm a believer and a happy customer!</p>",
            "author_name": "Brandy Y",
            "author_name_text": "Cyclist"
          }
        },
        "testimonail_ACckNf": {
          "type": "Testimonail",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-07-30_at_11.53.01_AM.png",
            "text": "<p>I love the extra boost I felt after just a few days on this. My body recovers faster after each workout. And, on the water, I can go farther without running out of air, strength, and drive. Solid product with solid results.</p>",
            "author_name": "Mark R",
            "author_name_text": "Kayak"
          }
        },
        "testimonail_eCHGmn": {
          "type": "Testimonail",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-07-30_at_11.54.41_AM.png",
            "text": "<p>I have been taking this creatine for over a month now and am seeing results! I feel stronger and I'm not sore day to day. It tastes good and I am seeing no negative side effects like I have on some other brands of creatine.</p>",
            "author_name": "M.S.",
            "author_name_text": "Gym"
          }
        },
        "testimonail_tU9X7P": {
          "type": "Testimonail",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-07-30_at_11.55.57_AM.png",
            "text": "<p>I’ve never really know what to look for in terms of results for a protein power and pre workout, but when I started using Xendurance I knew exactly what I’d been missing. Powders are so finely cute, they don’t clump up when mixed with water and pre workout doesn’t make me feel like I’m about to have a heart attack</p>",
            "author_name": "Jennifer C.",
            "author_name_text": "Athlete"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "testimonail_nLk4Ud",
